  {
    "id": "1935268506481856651",
    "author": {
      "id": "1495931005857046528",
      "username": "Linguista2025",
      "name": "Linguista",
      "profile_image_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1908813846141190144/PeyzcyMF_400x400.jpg",
      "verified": false
    },
    "text": "数学界传奇格里戈里·佩雷尔曼曾拒绝菲尔兹奖和百万美元奖金。他说：“我对金钱或名声不感兴趣。如果证明是正确的，就不需要其他认可。”他的选择让整个学术界震惊。",
    "created_at": "2025-06-18T09:29:02.000Z",
    "metrics": {
      "like_count": 0,
      "retweet_count": 0,
      "reply_count": 1,
      "quote_count": 0,
      "view_count": 146,
